'''AYE AYE Monthly Cup #1''' is a one-day double bracket duel tournament which will take place on Saturday 26th November 2022 at 19:00 UTC. It will have an upper and lower division and will take place on the maps [[Catalyst]], [[Panzer]] and [[Aerowalk]].

==Format==
* Double Elimination (will switch to round robin if there aren't many players)
* BO1
* Map pool: [[Catalyst]], [[Panzer]], [[Aerowalk]] (rnd, drop, drop play)

